Begin3
Title:          MetaKern
Version:        11oct2003
Entered-date:   2003-10-11
Description:    Allows to install several DOS / Windows kernels on a single  disk or partition: Loaded by the FreeDOS boot sector, MetaKern lets the user select a kernel at boot time. Read the manual before use!
Keywords:       dual boot, boot menu, freedos, dos, windows
Author:         Eric Auer eric -at- coli.uni-sb.de
Maintained-by:  Eric Auer eric -at- coli.uni-sb.de
Primary-site:   http://www.auersoft.org/freedos/specials/
Alternate-site: http://www.coli.uni-sb.de/~eric/stuff/soft/specials/
Original-site:  http://www.coli.uni-sb.de/~eric/stuff/soft/specials/
Platforms:      DOS, Windows (FAT filesystem versions only)
Copying-policy: GPL 2
